    "sentence_translations": [
      "Whisperings",
      "",
      "Little Ming and his parents went window-shopping.",
      "Mom fell for a set of plates and insisted on buying it, but dad thought it was too expensive and did not agree.",
      "",
      "Little Ming saw how much mom liked it, and secretly whispered something to his dad.",
      "After hearing his words, dad said nothing more and bought the plates.",
      "",
      "The shop assistant beside them thought it strange, and asked Little Ming what he said to his dad.",
      "Little Ming said: “I told dad that if he buys such expensive plates, mom won’t make him do the dishes.”"
    ]
